# Escondite Vertice, B3F (villain hideout B3F, C4b, contract 41), 14 x 16, interior. The deepest floor you can reach on foot: the stairs from B2F arrive at the top left (door (2,2)) and the belts lead (eight platform hops) to the
# platform of the grunt who carries the Hoist Key (`key_grunt`: a fight, then `llave_polea`, flags 812 / 803). Two more grunts and items; there is no way further down: B4F (Varo) is reached only by the elevator.
@map escondite_3
@size 14 16
@interior yes
@area escondite_vertice
@bg 3
@fill metal_00
@spawn up 2 3 S
@flag lift_key_given 803
@flag key_beaten 812
@legend
